.TH SDL_RequestNotificationPermission 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_RequestNotificationPermission \- Requests permission from the system to display notifications.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_notification.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_RequestNotificationPermission(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A return value of
.BR true
only means that the system supports notifications, and that the request for permission was successfully issued\[char46] It does not reflect any user settings to allow or deny notifications\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns True on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_ShowNotification (3),
.BR SDL_ShowNotificationWithProperties (3),
.BR SDL_NotificationAction (3type)
